[25.801989, "o", "1. **Filter Users**: Include only users who are '\"'\"'active'\"'\"' (status is '\"'\"'active'\"'\"').\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[25.80204, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.802221, "o", "2. **Parse and Format Dates**: Convert the '\"'\"'last_login'\"'\"' ISO 8601 timestamp into a date string in the format '\"'\"'YYYY-MM-DD'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.802274, "o", "3. **Extract and Rename Fields**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.802339, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'id'\"'\"' as '\"'\"'user_id'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[25.802374, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.802422, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'username'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[25.802446, "o", "> "]
[25.802473, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'email'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[25.802491, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
