[25.802586, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.802686, "o", "   - Extract the count of roles as '\"'\"'role_count'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.802834, "o", "   - Extract the first role from the '\"'\"'roles'\"'\"' array as '\"'\"'primary_role'\"'\"' (if roles exist, otherwise null).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[25.80287, "o", "> "]
[25.802981, "o", "4. **Sort Users**: Sort the resulting users alphabetically by their '\"'\"'username'\"'\"' in ascending order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[25.803004, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[25.803158, "o", "5. **Output Format**: The output must be a JSON array of objects formatted with indentation of 2 spaces.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
